  "extractionNotes": "Father's own 9 weeks of parental leave (63 days), claimed on a ZUR after the mother used 20 weeks of maternity (2025-08-05..2025-12-22) and 32 weeks of parental (2025-12-23..2026-08-03), both at 81.5%; ZUS printed the mother's benefit history and added a handwritten note, and the father declared her parental period on the ZUR. Grant evidenced by benefit title 1240 from 2026-09-14 on the ZUS titles screen (queried up to 2026-11-15); the end date is the claim. The leave starts after the child's first birthday. Employment from 2025-04-02, full time, about 4 months before the birth. Z-3 salary table 2025-09..2026-08 at the minimum wage (4,666.00 in 2025, 4,806.00 in 2026), sickness in 2025-09, 2025-10 and 2026-06 (fewer days worked); contributionBase inferred equal to column 6. Rate not printed (70% by law for the father's reserved weeks). asOf = date of the leave application to the employer from the Z-3 (no dated ZUS document). Birth date from the ZUR (the birth extract is illegible)."
